          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On July 3, 1982, a witness saw from the window of his kitchen a 20cm-diameter orange ball that was twinkling. The weather was very stormy, and the ball was in front of a cloud formation approaching the area. During the observation, which lasted over a minute, the ball maintained the same trajectory and moved quickly. The phenomenon disappeared abruptly. No other information was gathered about this event.",
